<title>USA: U.S. coffee roastings fall in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. coffee roastings fall in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Complete Coffee Coverage reported U.S. green coffee roastings as follows:</p>
<p>For the week ended March 8, roastings totaled approximately 305,000 60-kg bags, down from 325,000 bags the previous week and compared with 310,000 bags in the corresponding week one year ago.</p>
<p>Cumulative roastings totaled 3,620,000 60-kg bags, versus 3,480,000 bags in the same year ago period. -- New York Commodity Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
